      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Stuff like this is why I don't like using VRCObjectSync unless I have to.\n\nIt seems like once the object is enabled, it still receives and sets position data *event if we own it and already set it to be in a different position*.\n\nI'm pretty sure this is a bug? Or at least unexpected behavior.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
